{
  "_comment": "Golden decision tests. BAC-xx = BRD acceptance criteria; SCN-xx = BRD/prototype scenarios; X-xx = architect edge cases. 'set' overrides dot-paths on the base persona; 'remove' deletes list items. Every rule change must keep this suite green (CI gate).",
